{"schemaVersion":1,"id":32,"sections":[{"id":"113007-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1050],"start":0,"count":8},{"id":"113007-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11040],"start":8,"count":9},{"id":"113008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1060],"start":17,"count":4},{"id":"113008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11050],"start":21,"count":9},{"id":"113009-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1070],"start":30,"count":8},{"id":"113009-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11060],"start":38,"count":12}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:2","scriptId":1050,"text":"之后又遇到了一些游荡的战车兽----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:3","scriptId":1050,"text":"“佐伊，右侧又有少量战车兽出现。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:4","scriptId":1050,"text":"“好嘞，看我一击必杀。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":37,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:5","scriptId":1050,"text":"自从看过教官的战斗之后，所有人都变得非常积极……（除了我以外）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":37,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:6","scriptId":1050,"text":"“普莉玛向四点钟方向发射高爆弹，注意不要打中佐伊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":37,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":98,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:7","scriptId":1050,"text":"“收到。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":98,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:8","scriptId":1050,"text":"“大家都很有精神嘛～战斗时的技术动作都还挺到位的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":98,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-PROLOGUE:1050:9","scriptId":1050,"text":"“那一定是看了教官您的战斗，大家都振奋了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:1","scriptId":11040,"text":"“不愧是能战胜桑赫斯特的队伍，学习能力很高啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:2","scriptId":11040,"text":"“怎么说？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:3","scriptId":11040,"text":"“你看佐伊和莉娜的动作，这是在模仿我刚才的防御姿势。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:4","scriptId":11040,"text":"“被您这么一说，确实是这样啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:5","scriptId":11040,"text":"“然而这些动作其实都在教科书上有教过……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":216,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:6","scriptId":11040,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":216,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:7","scriptId":11040,"text":"“看来实践训练的课程量还要加大啊，课本知识的吸收量还真是太有限了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:8","scriptId":11040,"text":"“恩，是可以适当加大。有提升自然是好，能快速提升绝对是好上加好。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113007-EPILOGUE:11040:9","scriptId":11040,"text":"（总觉得有点对不起伏龙芝的后辈们……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113008-PROLOGUE:1060:2","scriptId":1060,"text":"距离马奇诺大约还有两天的路程。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-PROLOGUE:1060:3","scriptId":1060,"text":"“前方发现大批战车兽，正在掠夺中继站的物资。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-PROLOGUE:1060:4","scriptId":1060,"text":"“立刻去支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-PROLOGUE:1060:5","scriptId":1060,"text":"“没问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:1","scriptId":11050,"text":"轻松拿下，继续向着马奇诺进发。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:2","scriptId":11050,"text":"“有没有觉得战车兽出现的越来越频繁了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:3","scriptId":11050,"text":"“是的，行进路线上面的阻碍越来越多，严重影响行进速度。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:4","scriptId":11050,"text":"“停下车。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:5","scriptId":11050,"text":"“？？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:6","scriptId":11050,"text":"“哦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:7","scriptId":11050,"text":"索菲亚教官从吉普车上下来，加入到了佐伊她们的队列之中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:8","scriptId":11050,"text":"“从现在开始，我也参加战斗队列，加快行进速度！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113008-EPILOGUE:11050:9","scriptId":11050,"text":"“好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:2","scriptId":1070,"text":"由于索菲亚教官的加入，队伍的行进速度大增。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:3","scriptId":1070,"text":"“现在的速度比之前快了好多。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:4","scriptId":1070,"text":"“恩，虽然战车兽比之前多了，但是因为教官在第一线开道，根本没有任何可以阻拦我们的东西……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:5","scriptId":1070,"text":"“连指挥都省了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:6","scriptId":1070,"text":"“连援护射击都不需要了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":92,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:7","scriptId":1070,"text":"“都给我认真点，不要以为我没有听到～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:8","scriptId":1070,"text":"“啊……无线电开着……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-PROLOGUE:1070:9","scriptId":1070,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:1","scriptId":11060,"text":"比预计速度快了很多，已经能看到研究所的外围了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:2","scriptId":11060,"text":"然而我们的队伍却并没有再前进一步，而是聚拢起来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:3","scriptId":11060,"text":"研究所外围有海量的战车兽包围着，仿佛在守护着这个研究所一般。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:4","scriptId":11060,"text":"“这个数量……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:5","scriptId":11060,"text":"“根本不可能突破啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":88,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:6","scriptId":11060,"text":"“虽然有教官在，不过这里的战车兽怎么一下子那么集中……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":88,"right":40,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:7","scriptId":11060,"text":"“果然和我预感的一样……清理起来比较麻烦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":88,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:8","scriptId":11060,"text":"“这个数量不是一时半会儿处理掉的吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:9","scriptId":11060,"text":"“确实，这种数量级，就算是我也不可能全身而退。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:10","scriptId":11060,"text":"“那就地扎营，慢慢推进。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:11","scriptId":11060,"text":"“恩，只能这样了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113009-EPILOGUE:11060:12","scriptId":11060,"text":"“有点掉以轻心了，原以为没什么问题，可恶……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":216,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["清理路过的战车兽……","离马奇诺研究所越来越近了。","教官也加入战斗序列了，这下速度大增……"]}
